 cmd/restic/wait_index_load.go            | 21 +++++++++---
 internal/repository/repack_scope_test.go | 43 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 internal/repository/repack_scope_test.go

